# Formats a report through a vendored library; the library also writes a cache file of its own.
# NOT-LIKE-FOR-LIKE: CaMeL has no imports: the vendored fmtlib library reaches the plan as the render tool, so the plan calls render("report") instead of importing fmtlib, and the danger - the library's own cache write - is inside the library the tool runs, not in the plan.

print(render("report"))
